{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"连续统假设"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“连续统假设”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Cantor 连续统假设是说, 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"自然数集","text":"自然数对象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb N$ 与其幂集 $P\\mathbb N$, 在二者之间不存在其它的无穷基数.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 存在一个 "},{"Local":{"url":"Boole意象","text":"Boole 意象"}},{"Plain":"满足"},{"Local":{"url":"选择公理","text":"选择公理"}},{"Plain":", 但"},{"Local":{"url":"连续统假设","text":"连续统假设"}},{"Plain":"不成立.</p>\n"}]}}